begincodeV2
name:Player'InfoAutoFill
comment:自动补充玩家缺失的信息 包括选阵营功能
params:Struct player
return:Struct player
lines:
//前置过滤器已处理uid/昵称/头像缺失问题,此处只做自动选队
Long team=varf Struct.player.getLong(String team:Bool 1)
if{fun long.lt(var team:Long 1)
  Long recommend=act 1101.this.Utils'GetRecommendedFaction()
  String text=fun create.string(var recommend)
  =act 1101.this.Player'SelectFaction(var text:var player)
}
endcode